<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Good Morning/Afternoon,</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Thank you for your email.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">You currently hold a finance lease agreement with us. As part of the terms and conditions of this agreement you will not own the asset.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Once the agreement has ended its primary period it will enter a secondary rental period. You will receive an annual charge for the agreement during this period. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Should you sell the vehicle to a 3<sup>rd</sup> party, we require you to send to us the sale of vehicle invoice. We will then raise an invoice for the rebate of rental charge for % of the sale of vehicle invoice. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Our financial interest in the agreement will be removed when the rebate of rental invoice has been paid to us. </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:16px;">Kind Regards,</span><span style="color:#444444"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
